{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The authentic game/simulator of the traditional \u201cEscoba\u201d or Escoba del 15. With high-resolution Spanish playing cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the most popular card game in Spain, Argentina, Colombia, Uruguay, etc. With very simple rules, you have to win as many cards as possible, as long as they add up to 15.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a comprehensive tutorial, as well as instructions, help, statistics, many configuration options, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 High-definition cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Option to use Spanish, French, or Italian (Neapolitan) decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 You can now also change the size of the cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Many high-definition backs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Incredible animations and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Play online with friends or offline against the AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Simple and minimalist interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Includes a tutorial and comprehensive help section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Realistic sounds with adjustable volume.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Optimized graphics for lower battery consumption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Configurable La Brisca rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Option to play in portrait or landscape mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Countless new features...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME MODES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Tutorial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Practice mode (allows you to undo moves)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Single player (4 difficulty levels)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Two players (coming soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Online play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's only one thing left to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENJOY!!!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Newbie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866030/e7adc43291ffbae8d507cd38f5bc10c39e453d3d.jpg"},{"name":"Tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866030/077907fc79f06bc7fe3c15b667c960479b815940.jpg"},{"name":"You have got it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866030/c24ea366c385bc8789785de988fd099727dfbd89.jpg"},{"name":"Gamer (Level 1)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866030/b560b4dd1ffcb9abba050b6b38f64bb13b144e75.jpg"},{"name":"Gamer (Level 2)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866030/6e60d2da02bad6844aff65598fdf4cbd04b4584b.jpg"},{"name":"Gamer (Level 3)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866030/0c6fe264d01e3880597bbd380d601ef6d93f3a76.jpg"},{"name":"Gamer (Level 4)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866030/3ffaa6ba8504773e8c4150e067ad0fd55436b886.jpg"},{"name":"Gamer (Level 5)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866030/1b4bd241bd48c325c3cc9e53f1eea87446ceebee.jpg"},{"name":"I vs 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866030/6efe3983c6c3b38b18508c8bc85471bd3a553d96.jpg"},{"name":"I vs 3 hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866030/aeec5fea0bc09e13c2d6d5f5491a79eba81a13f8.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866030?t=1759572631","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866030/1ed0e85e893744512b54fde8619156e35ae1df04/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759572631","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as