rable La Brisca rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Option to play in portrait or landscape mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Countless new features...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME MODES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Tutorial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Practice mode (allows you to undo moves)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Single player (4 difficulty levels)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Two players (coming soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Online play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's only one thing left to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENJOY!!!</p>","developers":["Quarzo Aplicaciones y Juegos SL"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866030/a22db00bc7b89e9ae48e31eea0b8857623aea268/header.jpg?t=1759572631","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866030/393739225/7bb9f05f3a923c2f53d8000a77c637adb67a63f5/1757496040/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758389390","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866030/393739225/7bb9f05f3a923c2f53d8000a77c637adb67a63f5/1757496040/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758389390","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866030/393739225/7bb9f05f3a923c2f53d8000a77c637adb67a63f5/1757496040/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758389390","id":257195523,"name":"V\u00eddeo base","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195523/d52c3b69a57cc9c567c5d6219a83ac0fb158f46c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758389390"}],"name":"Escoba","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Escoba - $4.99 USD","packageid":1359084,"percent_